[2026-05-10T14:08:23.803Z] [INFO] {"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_412","type":"reasoning","text":"**Investigating table settings**\n\nI'm thinking that the issue with the table folders being all zero might be due to `extractTableSettings` not correctly reading the nested object row requirements. However, I noticed that the end-to-end mock object from 269 does return an object row with those requirements nested. It makes me wonder if there were changes upstream in `extractTableSettings` within the table workspace. I need to investigate that further and inspect to understand what's happening."}}
