[2026-05-10T14:08:58.893Z] [INFO] {"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_417","type":"reasoning","text":"**Evaluating data handling**\n\nI’m considering the structure of the data. If the data is a dictionary map without `data.terms`, maybe I should return a normalized array from the object's entries. Alternatively, I could return `...payload` along with `termById` from the payload. \n\nI’m thinking of defining `rawTerms` based on whether the data is an array or based on its properties. Overall, it’s about determining the best way to handle and format this data.\n**Assessing service patch needs**\n\nI'm noticing a potential issue where the `terms` object map causes `payload?.terms` to be evaluated early as true. The `normalizeTableList` object map seems to handle this well. I realize I need to patch the service and also test the `normalizeTermsResponse` object map, perhaps adding to it. An end-to-end test will cover it, but unit tests are better. I should check the `termsFixture` for its role in the `terms` object as well."}}
