## Summary
- Ported the legacy dictionary and edit_types flows onto Vue JSON API contracts without changing backend endpoint names.
- Added fixtures and contract coverage for metadata tree data, type detail data, DDL mutation responses, and validation errors.
- Added a shared edit_types normalizer, permission-gated schema/type actions, legacy category settings load/save, and corrected table workspace handling for normalized term payloads.
- Added component coverage for schema tree edit/save payloads plus Playwright smoke coverage for /my/dict and /my/edit_types.

## Testing
- npm test -- --reporter=dot
- npm run build
- PLAYWRIGHT_PORT=32021 npm run test:e2e

